             DEFAULT_INITIAL_RADIUS,
             DEFAULT_STOPPING_RADIUS);
    }

    /**
     * @param numberOfInterpolationPoints Number of interpolation conditions.
     * For a problem of dimension {@code n}, its value must be in the interval
     * {@code [n+2, (n+1)(n+2)/2]}.
