* <a href="http://mathworld.wolfram.com/InverseSine.html" TARGET="_top">
* inverse sine</a> of this complex number.
* Implements the formula:
* <pre>
* <code>
* asin(z) = -i (log(sqrt(1 - z<sup>2</sup>) + iz))
* </code>
* </pre>
